NOT DISTRIBUTED WITH THIS PACKAGE
---------------------------------
Earlier versions of the Diablo II Archipelago package also contained d2gl
(GPL-3.0), SlashGaming Diablo II Free Resolution (AGPL-3.0-or-later) and DSOAL
(LGPL-2.1). Bundling them was a mistake: distributing a copyleft program in the
same package as this one raises obligations that this project cannot honour,
and the question of how far those obligations reach is not one to settle by
guessing.

They are optional graphics and sound add-ons, not part of the mod. They are no
longer distributed, and the launcher does not download them. The game's README
explains what each one does, where to download it from its own author, and how
to install it -- the same way the player already supplies their own copy of
Diablo II. The game runs without them.

